DeepThought

Structural declaration mappings and name-field extraction were adapted from
the original DeepThought Tree-sitter analyzer, Copyright (c) 2025 DeepThought,
under the MIT license retained in licenses/deepthought-original-MIT.txt.
Database, hosted configuration, model providers and graph inference are omitted
from this selected extraction path.

The portable AnalysisTool interface, registry and standardized tool records
are adapted from that project's MIT-licensed tool interfaces and contracts.
The standalone TreeSitterTool uses this SDK's declaration extractor; its initial
Python/TypeScript profile does not port the legacy call/control/data-flow models.

The vendored SCIP protocol schema originates from Sourcegraph SCIP:
https://github.com/sourcegraph/scip
It is distributed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE.
The schema was carried forward from the original DeepThought copy. Python
bindings were regenerated using protoc 35.1, with a private descriptor pool
to avoid host binding collisions. Regeneration: python tools/generate_scip.py.
